From: smit1237 <smit1237@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:47:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/30] router: NAT data plane, LAN services and operator
 config

S60routing sets the routing sysctls (ip_forward, BBR/fq, route_localnet),
regenerates the dnsmasq scope and the nftables ruleset via the portal nftgen
module with validate-before-swap, and applies it. S30eth addresses eth0 by
DHCP or static per /etc/rnsbox/wan.conf. Ship the dnsmasq/dhcpcd/nftables
fallback/fstab configuration and the wan/portforward/openports operator files.
